.TH flightlog-skills-install 1 2026-09-29 "flightlog 0.2.2" "flightlog manual"
.SH NAME
flightlog\-skills\-install \- Install the skills for every agent found here, or the ones named
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBflightlog skills install\fR [\fB\-\-agent\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR] [\fB\-\-overwrite\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR] [\fB\-\-yolo\fR] [\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install the skills for every agent found here, or the ones named.
.PP
Always writes ~/.agents/skills (read by opencode, Copilot, Cursor, Gemini CLI and Codex), plus the skill folder of each agent whose config directory exists. Restart the agent afterwards.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR \fI<AGENT>\fR
Only these agents (comma\-separated)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
claude: Claude Code: ~/.claude/skills
.IP \(bu 2
codex: Codex: ~/.codex/skills
.IP \(bu 2
opencode: opencode: ~/.config/opencode/skills
.IP \(bu 2
copilot: GitHub Copilot CLI: ~/.copilot/skills
.IP \(bu 2
cursor: Cursor: ~/.cursor/skills
.IP \(bu 2
gemini: Gemini CLI: ~/.gemini/skills
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-path\-checks\fR
Allow traversal, absolute destinations and filesystem symlinks
.TP
\fB\-\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Install into this directory instead
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-size\-checks\fR
Disable Flightlog archive, entry and input size limits
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-checksums\fR
Ignore manifest SHA\-256 mismatches (ZIP decoding must still succeed)
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-format\-checks\fR
Skip bundle schema and file\-inventory validation
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-content\-checks\fR
Skip input redaction and opaque\-content checks, regardless of manifest mode
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
Replace existing outputs and restore files; merge extraction directories
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-http\fR
Permit plaintext HTTP transfers
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-unredacted\fR
Accept explicitly unredacted bundles for private migration
.TP
\fB\-\-yolo\fR
Disable redaction and every bypassable safety check; overwrite outputs
.TP
\fB\-\-redact\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
File of private literal names/domains to redact (one per line; kept local)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  flightlog skills install
  flightlog skills install \-\-agent claude,codex
  flightlog skills install \-\-dir .claude/skills      # this project only
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flightlog (1)
